WEBVTT

01:35:22.417 --> 01:35:23.417
and on Saturdays…

01:35:24.000 --> 01:35:25.000
Balaji temple.

01:35:27.667 --> 01:35:28.542
Balaji temple.

01:35:28.625 --> 01:35:29.500
WEDNESDAY

01:35:29.584 --> 01:35:31.625
But the catch is he's flying
to Delhi Thursday night.

01:35:31.750 --> 01:35:33.459
He won't be back until next Wednesday.

01:35:33.584 --> 01:35:37.209
Sir, we told the clients that the
agreement will be done by Sunday.

01:35:37.500 --> 01:35:40.000
If we postpone it, they'll
cancel the deal altogether.
